  "description": "Official .NET 8 SDK for evaluating and managing Maxlona feature flags. Every check is evaluated live against the Maxlona service over HTTP, so a decision always reflects the current flag configuration with nothing to invalidate or refresh. Resilient by default: Polly retries with exponential backoff, per-attempt timeouts, plain-language firewall and proxy diagnostics, and a Serilog file log. Includes typed variants, targeting context, decision explanations, dependency injection, and the full public Management API. See https://maxlona.com/wiki/sdk for installation and usage.",
